  <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to delete your account and all data: <span class="text-ink-strong">[support email]</span>.</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-muted">Last updated: [date]</p>
</article>
